timestamp=2026-08-31T19:20:00.815Z level=INFO run=532d90f3 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c \"\nimport csv\nwith open('data/kaggle/fifa_data.csv', encoding='utf-8') as fh:\n    r = csv.DictReader(fh)\n    nat = {}\n    clubs = {}\n    n = 0\n    for row in r:\n        n += 1\n        nat[row['Nationality']] = nat.get(row['Nationality'],0)+1\n        c = row['Club']\n        clubs[c] = clubs.get(c,0)+1\nprint('rows', n, 'cols', len(row))\nprint('Brazilians:', nat.get('Brazil'))\nbr = {c:v for c,v in clubs.items() if any(w in c for w in ['Flamengo','Palmeiras','Corinthians','Santos','So Paulo','Sao Paulo','Gremio','Fluminense','Vasco','Bahia','Sport','Athletico','Atltico','Botafogo','Cruzeiro','Internacional','Fortaleza','Bragantino','Cuiab'])}\nprint(sorted(br.items()))\nprint('Overall dtype sample:', row['Overall'])\n\"" action.permission=bash action.action=allow action.pattern=*
